{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>Olive Young環保袋正式開賣</h2>\n<p>Olive Young購物袋原本只是加購選項的防水帆布袋，憑着大容量、耐用與標誌性外觀，搖身成為韓國旅遊的代表性單品！Olive Young宣布將這款人氣購物袋正式獨立發售，並首次新增中型版本。過去它主要作為消費後的加購選項，如今終於成為可單獨購買。\n</p>\n<h2>人手一個 搭飛機必備</h2>\n<p>大型款售價維持3,000韓元，約16港元；全新中型款則為2,000韓元，約11港元。中型款體積約為大型款一半，更適合裝載零食、面膜或手信，攜帶起來更輕便。大型款採用防水帆布（Tarpaulin）材質，堅韌耐用，容量驚人，能輕鬆裝下大量面膜、彩妝、保養品與零食。正因如此，不少旅客會把它當成旅行中的「第二行李袋」，甚至直接帶上機艙使用。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484482581049733_18357974806afb289a3b4ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484482581049733_18357974806afb289a3b4ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484482781027016_12474393276afb289c392fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484482781027016_12474393276afb289c392fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484482970537000_8614393786afb289e09be8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179484482970537000_8614393786afb289e09be8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfzmO5-E3Ki/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:21:01.015967+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":418,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK"